<h2>Hello <%= @user.name %>,</h2>

<p>Thank you for signing up for Bizz-Hunter! Please verify your email address to unlock all features.</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @verify_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold;">
    Verify Email Address
  </a>
</p>

<p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p><code><%= @verify_url %></code></p>

<p>This verification link will expire in 24 hours.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>The Bizz-Hunter Team</p>
